---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { images } from "../data/site";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-bone py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:items-center">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Why Reyes</p>
      <h2 class="max-w-[20ch] text-[clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1.02]">
        The roof decides the next step.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
        A roof is more than the material you can see. It is flashing,
        penetrations, transitions, drainage and the structure underneath — and
        the right answer depends on what condition those are in.
      </p>

      <ol class="mt-10 space-y-7">
        <li class="flex gap-5">
          <span
            class="font-display text-[0.85rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-red"
            aria-hidden="true">01</span
          >
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[1.1rem]">Understand the concern</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.92rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
              The leak, the stain, the shingles on the lawn — start with what
              you have noticed.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-5">
          <span
            class="font-display text-[0.85rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-red"
            aria-hidden="true">02</span
          >
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[1.1rem]">Evaluate the roofing system</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.92rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
              The visible symptom is not always the whole story. Materials,
              flashing and drainage get looked at together.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-5">
          <span
            class="font-display text-[0.85rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-red"
            aria-hidden="true">03</span
          >
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[1.1rem]">Recommend the right direction</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.92rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
              Repair, maintenance, replacement or installation — without turning
              every roofing concern into the same recommendation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <figure class="relative" data-reveal>
      <Image
        src={images.team}
        alt="Reyes Roofing LLC truck at a home in Arizona"
        class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover object-[center_60%]"
        widths={[600, 1000]}
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 92vw"
        format="webp"
        quality={66}
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption
        class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 max-w-[15rem] bg-ink/95 px-5 py-4 text-[0.8rem] leading-snug text-bone/85"
      >
        Family-owned, working roofs across Arizona.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
